Subject: [PATCH 06/11] =?UTF-8?q?feat:=20rtthread=E6=94=AF=E6=8C=81?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=E4=BB=8Euart=E8=AF=BB=E5=8F=96=E5=91=BD=E4=BB=A4?=
